      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T15:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The doc [1] says cinder-api/scheduler and cinder-volume\n\n- cinder-scheduler → sends capacity metrics\n- cinder-volume → sends volume/snapshot/backup events\n- cinder-api → sends volume/snapshot events\n\nThose are `notify_about_capacity_usage`, `notify_about_volume_usage`, `notify_about_backup_usage`, and `notify_about_snapshot_usage` methods in the volume_utils.py [2]\n\nThe scheduler code explitictly confirms the scheduler piece \n\n[1] https://docs.openstack.org/ceilometer/latest/install/cinder/install-cinder-ubuntu.html\n[2] https://opendev.org/openstack/cinder/src/branch/stable/2026.1/cinder/volume/volume_utils.py#L164\n[3] https://opendev.org/openstack/cinder/src/branch/stable/2026.1/cinder/scheduler/host_manager.py#L976",
      "parentUuid": "a517e03c_77781d51",
      "revId": "3deaa79b23f59d05a4c24941b5dc6bee36c89c51",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
